<title>PHILIPPINES: Pryce sets 15 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Pryce sets 15 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pryce Properties Corp has declared a 15 percent stock dividend to all shareholders, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a notice record date for the dividend is yet to be determined.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
